@gateway = https://<your-apim-gateway-host>
@accessToken = <delegated-user-token-for-API_SCOPE>
@subscriptionKey = <inference-product-subscription-key>

### For exported client spans and W3C propagation, use scripts.trace_inference.
### These plain HTTP examples retain UUID correlation but are not an instrumented client.

### Non-streaming Chat. Identity and budgets follow the validated user.
POST {{gateway}}/foundry/chat/completions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{subscriptionKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"model":"gpt-5.4-mini","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"Say hello."}],"max_completion_tokens":100}

### Streaming Chat. The gateway also forces final provider usage.
POST {{gateway}}/foundry/chat/completions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{subscriptionKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"model":"gpt-5.4-mini","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"Say hello."}],"max_completion_tokens":100,"stream":true,"stream_options":{"include_usage":true}}

### Responses (streaming)
POST {{gateway}}/foundry/responses
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{subscriptionKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"model":"gpt-5.4-mini","input":"Say hello.","max_output_tokens":100,"stream":true}
